<div style="flex:1" className={styles.pvlColumn} class="column" data-zesty-id="design:columns:1 Column:15:76-1:1 Column:0">
<img src="https://s3.amazonaws.com/uss-cache.salvationarmy.org/df6a394d-bfe9-44bb-8ef7-be806a9a77ef_Copy+of+Stuff+the+Bus%2C+7-30-25%2C+v.4+%28Website%29.png" alt="placeholder" class="img-fluid w-100 d-block mx-auto" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy" / data-zesty-id="content:images:0:3345">
<p data-zesty-id="content:textarea:1:3">
	Join us on Wednesday July 30th at the Peters Creek Walmart in Winston-Salem at&nbsp;3475 Parkway Village Court.
</p>
<p data-zesty-id="content:textarea:2:49">
	We will be there from 7:00am to 7:00pm.
</p>
<p data-zesty-id="content:textarea:3:42">
	After you are done shopping, please stop by to donate school supplies to kids in need.
</p>
<p data-zesty-id="content:textarea:4:3">&nbsp;<br><strong>Here are some ideas for things kids need most:&nbsp; </strong></p>
<p data-zesty-id="content:textarea:5:63">
	&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; -&nbsp; Bookbags, notebooks, pencils, colored pencils, markers, crayons, glue sticks, scissors, erasers, pencil bags,
</p>
<p data-zesty-id="content:textarea:6:28">
	&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;3-ring binders, loose-leaf paper, hand sanitizer.
</p>
<div class="py-5" data-zesty-id="design:design:whitespace-xl:7:56"></div>
<p data-zesty-id="content:textarea:8:95">
	There are hundreds, if not thousands, of children in the Winston-Salem area who cannot afford the basic school supplies.
</p>
<p data-zesty-id="content:textarea:9:18">
	With your help, we can give them the supplies and the confidence to show up at school ready to learn!&nbsp;
</p>
<div class="py-5" data-zesty-id="design:design:whitespace-xl:10:16"></div>
<p data-zesty-id="content:wysiwyg_basic:11:86">
	Or, you can <a href="https://give.salvationarmycarolinas.org/give/424184/#!/donation/checkout" target=""><strong>donate now</strong></a>, if that works better for you.
</p>
<div class="my-2" data-zesty-id="design:design:whitespace-sm:12:68"></div>
<p data-zesty-id="content:textarea:13:5">
	Thanks so much!
</p>
